# Jumble, Tumble, Diamond Fuss (Q108): a dwarven fighter of level 10 accepts at Gouph and runs his
# contract through Reep, Torocco, Maron and Brunon; nine goblin brigand leaders and a lieutenant
# give the ten aquamarines and chrysoberyls (every roll pinned to succeed); the gem box goes to
# Gouph, the coal to Brunon, the letter to Murdoc, the tart to Airy, a blade bat gives the star
# diamond, and Gouph gives the Silversmith Hammer, the newbie soulshots and the echo crystals;
# then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
